@startuml seq_boot_check_failed
title SC-BOOT-03 - checkMemory or checkProgrammingDependencies failed

participant "UDS tester" as Tester
participant "Plant model" as Plant
box "TCU"
participant "PBL" as PBL
participant "SBL" as SBL
end box

note over Tester, SBL
Covers: SYS-BOOT-001, SYS-BOOT-002, SYS-BOOT-008, SYS-BOOT-013, SYS-BOOT-015, SIM-TST-001, SIM-TST-002, SIM-PLT-004, SG-06
UDS requests on DIAG_PhysReq 0x7E1, responses on DIAG_Resp 0x7E9 (can_matrix section 5).
CAN frames pass can0 / slcand / gateway transparently (DC-05, SIM-GW-001), see SC-STA-04.
end note

alt SBL image: CRC mismatch at checkMemory in the PBL (step 10)
  Tester -> PBL : 31 01 02 02 <crc32>
  PBL --> Tester : 71 01 02 02 01
  note right: 1 = CRC mismatch (reprogramming section 11)
  Tester -> PBL : 31 01 03 01
  PBL --> Tester : 7F 31 24
  note right: requestSequenceError: the last 0202 did not return 0\n(reprogramming section 11.1); the SBL is not started
  opt 0202 returned 0 but the SBL header is invalid (magic 0x53544178, header_crc32)
    Tester -> PBL : 31 01 03 01
    PBL --> Tester : 7F 31 22
    note right: conditionsNotCorrect (reprogramming section 11.1)
  end
  Tester -> Tester : stop with a clear message (SIM-TST-001)
  note over PBL: the application in flash is unchanged: after the next reset the PBL\nstarts it if it is valid (SYS-BOOT-001), otherwise stays in the default session
else application image: CRC mismatch at checkMemory in the SBL (step 17)
  Tester -> SBL : 31 01 02 02 <crc32>
  SBL -> SBL : CRC mismatch -> erase the flash sector that holds the application\nheader (0x0001_4000) before the response (SYS-BOOT-015)
  SBL --> Tester : 71 01 02 02 01
  Tester -> SBL : 31 01 FF 01
  SBL --> Tester : 7F 31 24
  note right: requestSequenceError: the last 0202 of the\napplication did not return 0 (reprogramming section 11.1)
  Tester -> Tester : stop with a clear message (SIM-TST-001)
else checkProgrammingDependencies fails (step 18)
  Tester -> SBL : 31 01 FF 01
  SBL -> SBL : header invalid / hw_id not 0x0947_0001 / min_pbl_version > PBL version\n-> erase the sector that holds the application header (SYS-BOOT-015)
  SBL --> Tester : 71 01 FF 01 01 | 02 | 03
  note right: 1 header invalid, 2 hw_id mismatch,\n3 PBL version too old (reprogramming section 11)
  Tester -> Tester : stop with a clear message (SIM-TST-001)
end

== after the application branches: next reset (11 01, S3 timeout or power cycle) ==
Tester -> SBL : 11 01
SBL --> Tester : 51 01
note over PBL, SBL: reset: the SBL in RAM is discarded
PBL -> PBL : application check fails (header sector erased), without a processor fault\n(SYS-BOOT-001, SYS-BOOT-013)
PBL -> PBL : stay in the bootloader, default session, no time limit (SYS-BOOT-002)
note over PBL: no TCU_Actuators / TCU_Status (SYS-BOOT-008)
Plant -> Plant : no TCU_Actuators for 50 ms: hydraulic default (SIM-PLT-004)
Tester -> PBL : 22 F1 81
PBL --> Tester : 62 F1 81 FF FF FF FF
note over Tester, SBL
Safe state of SG-06: the rejected image is never started; the TCU stays in the bootloader with the plant in the hydraulic default.
Recovery: a full new programming sequence from the PBL default session (SC-BOOT-05).
end note
@enduml
